  <title id="title">Console — Zane Wang's terminal session profile</title>
  <desc id="desc">A terminal-window profile composed as one tmux session with 7 sections: identity; 12 pull requests merged by the maintainers of axum, SQLx, AnyIO, goose, Fastify, Zod, TanStack Query, Tenacity, Feast, and Claude HUD; the tools Zane maintains (claudemem, handoff, dev-orchestrator); working method; activity from GitHub's contribution calendar; languages backed by shipped code; and an AI sidekick. Activity numbers and the snake refresh nightly.</desc>

